Hi, there:
=20
    As fas as I know, the following bluetooh directories are where BlueZ
located:
=20
1. linux/drivers/bluetooth  (for bluetooth device driver)
2. linux/net/bluetooth        (for bluetooth protocol stack)
3. linux/include/net/bluetooth (for bluetooth include file)
=20
   Is there any other I miss ?
=20
thanks a lot,
